SUMMARY:AVL International Connections - September Mixer
DESCRIPTION:AVL International Connections\nFor our **September Internation
 al Mixer** we will gather on the beautiful riverside deck @ New Belgium Br
 ewery (River Arts District)! If you are new\, there will be lots of folks 
 to welcome you!! If you haven't come for a few months\, come and meet some
  new folks!\n\nWeather permitting\, we will be outside on New Belgium’s 
 beautiful deck overlooking the river. If it is raining\, we’ll move insi
 de to the taproom. Look for the Meetup signs and the AVL International Con
 nections' name tags. Grab a cold beverage and then join us!\n\nA local Foo
 d Truck will also be out front if anyone wants a bite to eat!\n\nAs a grow
 ing group (over **1600** members)\, if you have friends that you would lik
 e to bring along\, please do! Also encourage them to sign up on Meetup!
